{
 "atom": "cli/atoms/std-orb-lint-service-registry.lolo",
 "trait": "ServiceRegistry",
 "note": "Cases for the shared services registry reader. The projection is what the Rust parse_service_registry_data keeps for the service lints: per service its actions, per action the declared params with the kind checkable_type gives their declared type (string, number, boolean, object or map, array or a list type, a quoted literal union is a string, a named type is not checked) and whether a non-empty response shape names a key field. A service with no action is declared-only.",
